 "short": "线性传播",
 "lead": "弱到原子可作线性响应的场如何在共振介质中传播：<span data-concept=\"susceptibility\">电极化率</span>，以及它所编码的<span data-concept=\"absorption-coefficient\">吸收</span>、<span data-concept=\"refractive-index\">折射</span>和<span data-concept=\"dispersion\">色散</span>，由<span data-concept=\"two-level-atom\">二能级原子</span>构成的气体在共振处和远离共振处的电极化率及其<span data-concept=\"absorption-cross-section\">吸收截面</span>，以及<span data-concept=\"homogeneous-broadening\">均匀</span>和<span data-concept=\"inhomogeneous-broadening\">非均匀谱线增宽</span>、尤其是<span data-concept=\"doppler-broadening\">多普勒谱线增宽</span>如何决定吸收谱的形状。",
